    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Scope and missing labels",
      "description": "Why failure_category and Tempo panels are absent.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 48
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Triage aid, not alerting.** Phase 33.3 ships no Grafana alert rules and no notification integrations.\n\n**`failure_category` is not available.** The tag is defined in the Phase 32 contract but does **not** appear on any live metric series, so failure-category breakdowns are omitted rather than written against a label that would never match. Failures are instead broken down by `outcome` and `operation`, which *are* exported.\n\n**Runtime cycle failures:** `irandirect_runtime_cycles_failed_total` is instrumented but was never observed - the panel stays empty until a cycle actually fails.\n\n**Tempo availability** is not queryable from Prometheus in this stack (Tempo publishes no scraped metrics here), so no Tempo panel is provided. Use the dashboard link above to reach Tempo directly."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alert coverage & runbooks",
      "description": "How to reach alerts and runbooks for this dashboard.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1000
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Alerts on this dashboard are evaluated by Prometheus**, not Grafana.\nAlertmanager (local default) routes everything to a no-op receiver; alerts are\nvisible at [Alertmanager UI](http://localhost:9095) and via the Prometheus\n**Alerts** page. Resolve/silence there.\n\n**Runbooks** (repo-relative paths):\n- `IranDirectCollectorUnavailable` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/collector-unavailable.md`\n- `IranDirectPrometheusTargetDown` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/prometheus-target-down.md`\n- `IranDirectAlertmanagerUnavailable` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/alertmanager-unavailable.md`\n- `IranDirectTempoUnavailable` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/tempo-unavailable.md`\n- `IranDirectGrafanaUnavailable` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/grafana-unavailable.md`\n- `IranDirectCollectCertificateOrAuthFailure` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/certificate-or-authentication-failure.md`\n\nAll runbooks: `deployment/observability/runbooks/`"
      }
    }
